msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
msgid "I-"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Player message in an effect
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
msgid ""
"Boann dismissively waves a hand before you can say anything, and you are "
"enveloped by a swirl of multicolored lights."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
msgid ""
"I came here with my court when the Hedge between our worlds thinned and the "
"border marches expanded.  They came for conquest and I came here for "
"coexistence."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
msgid "So you're a good faerie?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
msgid "How can I join your court?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
msgid "I am ready to leave this world for yours."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
msgid "I'd like some advice about the Jabberwock."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
msgid "I'd like some advice about the march lords."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
msgid "I'd like some advice about that dog."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
msgid "I'd like some advice about the Mi-Go guards."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
msgid "I'd like some advice about the armored centipede."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
msgid "I'd like some advice about the automaton."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
msgid "I'd like some advice about the triffid heart"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
msgid "I'd like some advice about the titan stag beetle"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
msgid "I'd like some advice about the shadow and its piece"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
msgid "I'd like some advice about the star-crowned hound"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
msgid "I'm back and I killed the Jabberwock.  [Give her the heart]"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Nickname for creature 'mon_melian_mantis_mount' in an effect
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
msgid "Bladepetal"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
msgid "I'm back and I killed the March Lords."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
msgid "I'm back and I killed that dog-like thing."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
msgid "I'm back and I killed the Mi-Go guards."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
msgid "I'm back and I killed the armored centipede"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
msgid "I'm back and I killed the automaton."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
msgid "I'm back and I killed the triffid heart.  [Give her the heart chunk]"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
msgid "I'm back and I killed the titan stag beetle"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
msgid "I'm back and I killed the Shadow.  [Give her the piece of shadow]"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
msgid "I'm back and I killed the star-crowned hound"
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
msgid ""
"Some of my kind might find that word pejorative, but it's what you've called "
"us for so very long.  It had been quite a while since we were last able to "
"come in numbers to this world, until the last few years."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
msgid "Why were you able to return?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
msgid "Well those of us who aren't faeries have other places to be now."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
msgid ""
"The same thing that is causing the portal storms made travel between our "
"worlds easier again.  We have to engage in fairly strenuous decontamination "
"procedures on our way back but we've had those in place for aeons."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
msgid ""
"Decontamination?  You can leave here and not worry about the risen dead?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
msgid "How can I join your court?  I want to leave here when you do!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
msgid "I'm going to head on now."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
msgid ""
"If we die here, we will rise just like you, we are within the belly of the "
"beast, so to speak here.  But yes when we go elsewhere we don't bring this "
"with us, that would be rude."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
msgid "Please take me away with you."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
msgid "I haven't decided if I believe you or not but I'll see you around."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
msgid ""
"Well you can't just join by asking, you need to accomplish a series of "
"progressively more difficult quests, bringing me trophies and relics proving "
"your worth to join our ranks."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
msgid "Do you have a quest for me now?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
msgid ""
"I have no other quests for you.  Once you'll have completed them all, you'll "
"become part of my court and allowed to move offworld when you will wish so."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
msgid ""
"(Boann hands you a list) Here is a list of the quests to complete to become "
"part of my court.  They are very difficult, but their rewards will be worth "
"it."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
msgid ""
"I have no new quests for now.  Once you'll have completed them, you'll become"
" one of my knights and able to accomplish the quests that will make you a "
"member of my court."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
msgid ""
"(Boann hands you a list) Here is a list of the quests to complete to become "
"one of my knights.  Take your time, they can be accomplished when you want."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
msgid "And when I'll be a knight you'll bring me out of here?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
msgid "[Bring me the heart of a Jabberwock]"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
msgid "[Find and kill two March Lords]"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
msgid "[Kill the suspicious dog]"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
msgid "[Kill an armored centipede]"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
msgid "[Kill the remains of a dreamforged automaton]"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
msgid "[Bring me back a chunk of a triffid heart]"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
msgid "[Kill a titan stag beetle]"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
msgid "[Bring me back a piece of the darkest shadow]"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
msgid "[Kill a star-crowned hound]"
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
msgid ""
"You won't be a member of my court yet.  After another few quests, you will, "
"and you along with all those that follow you will be brought out of this "
"world whenever you wish so."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
msgid "Can I see the quest list again?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Bring me the heart of a Jabberwock"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann_quests.json
msgid ""
"Prove to me that you have the heart of a knight.  Bring me the putrid heart "
"of a Jabberwock."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
msgid "I'll do it.  Where's the Jabberwock?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
msgid "Do you have any advice?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
msgid "I'm not sure if I want to do it.  See you."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
msgid ""
"You will need incredible melee skills to handle this or an impressive gun.  "
"Otherwise it do not have hidden tricks or notable intelligence so it'll be a "
"straightforward fight."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
msgid "Can I see the other quests first?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Bring me the heart of a Jabberwock"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill two March lords in my name"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill this suspicious dog for me"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill five Mi-Go guards for me"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill an armored centipede for me"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill the remains of a dreamforged automaton"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Bring me a chunk of a triffid heart"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill a titan stag beetle for me"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Bring me a piece of the darkest shadow"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill a star-crowned hound in my name"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann_quests.json
msgid "I had no doubts in you."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
msgid "Can I see the other quests?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Bring me the heart of a Jabberwock"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann_quests.json
msgid "I'm pleased to grant you a Melian mount of your own."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
msgid "Can I talk about something else?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill two March lords in my name"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann_quests.json
msgid ""
"Prove your allegiance to me.  Kill two March Lords so all will know which "
"side you fight."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
msgid "I'll do it."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
msgid ""
"They are fearsome opponents but lack long-range attacks.  You can find them "
"in the border patrol offices with their soldiers."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill two March lords in my name"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann_quests.json
msgid "I'm pleased to grant you the right to call upon the daffodil warriors."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill this suspicious dog for me"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann_quests.json
msgid ""
"A dog-like being has been found nearby.  Whatever it is, it's not a dog.  "
"Kill it, and I will teach you how to see beyond barriers."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
msgid "I'll do it.  Where's the dog?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill this suspicious dog for me"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann_quests.json
msgid ""
"Do not be deceived by its looks.  It is not a regular dog.  Be very careful "
"as we do not know what it can do."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
msgid ""
"I will now grant you the knowledge to see beyond all walls, written on this "
"parchment."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill five Mi-Go guards for me"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann_quests.json
msgid ""
"A knight must be able to face harsh conditions.  Kill five Mi-Go guards and "
"you'll receive an object able to refuel your magical energy."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
msgid "I'll do it.  Where's the guards?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill five Mi-Go guards for me"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann_quests.json
msgid ""
"Something to protect yourself from the fumes and heat is a must.  They are "
"smart enough to feel fear, so if they're injured enough they'll stop "
"attacking and try to flee."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
msgid "I'll do it. Where's the guards?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill five Mi-Go guards for me"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann_quests.json
msgid "Here is the object.  As promised, using it will recharge your mana."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill an armored centipede for me"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann_quests.json
msgid ""
"A knight must know how to triumph despite their foe's armor.  Kill an armored"
" centipede and I'll grant you an insignia, so you might be recognized as one "
"of my knights."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
msgid "I'll do it.  Where's the centipede?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill an armored centipede for me"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann_quests.json
msgid ""
"Study the weak spots of weaker centipedes, it'll give you an advantage.  Its "
"armor isn't as effective against blunt and piercing weapon than it is against"
" slashing weapons and bullets."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill an armored centipede for me"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann_quests.json
msgid "I'm honored to grant you this insignia."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill the remains of a dreamforged automaton"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann_quests.json
msgid ""
"A rampaging automaton has been spotted.  Destroy it, and you'll be granted a "
"great weapon."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
msgid "I'll do it.  Where's the automaton?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
msgid ""
"My scouts mentioned that it relies on electricity to attack.  Find a way to "
"shield yourself against that, and it'll be much easier to kill.  They also "
"mentioned how damaged the automaton's exposed insides are, so I wouldn't "
"attempt to use weapons that only damage the insides if I were you."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
msgid "I'm pleased to grant you this frostrimed estoc."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Bring me a chunk of a triffid heart"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann_quests.json
msgid ""
"I want you to brave the harshest environments.  Bring me a chunk of a triffid"
" heart and I'll grant you a powerful set of armor."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
msgid "I'll do it.  Where's the triffids?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Bring me a chunk of a triffid heart"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann_quests.json
msgid ""
"Tear gas is deadly to them.  In addition, they don't go along with anything "
"that isn't a triffid."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Bring me a chunk of a triffid heart"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann_quests.json
msgid "I'm pleased to grant you a set of armor appropriate for a knight."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill a titan stag beetle for me"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann_quests.json
msgid ""
"A knight must be able to triumph of all beasts.  Kill a titan stag beetle and"
" you'll receive a magical musical instrument."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
msgid "I'll do it.  Where's the beetle?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill a titan stag beetle for me"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann_quests.json
msgid ""
"Mundane weapons won't do much so try to find something that bypasses its "
"armor.  It's also very slow so keeping your distance is easy.  Learning the "
"weak points of smaller beetles and using high-power ammunitions can work too "
"but expect its shell to block most shots."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
msgid "I give you Väinämöinen's Kantele.  Take care of it, it's very precious."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
msgid ""
"There is a shadow that haunts the night.  Bring me proof that you killed it "
"and I'll grant you the right to bear my banner."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Bring me a piece of the darkest shadow"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann_quests.json
msgid ""
"To encounter it, stand alone or accompanied by at most two allies in a field "
"or a forest at night.  It might take multiple nights for it to show itself so"
" prepare something to do while you wait.  Light massively weaken it so ensure"
" the battlefield is well lit.  Separate it from its minions, as it can create"
" more than you'll manage to kill and heal its wounds over time.  It is also "
"particularly resilient against bullets so engage in melee if you manage to "
"get close enough."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Bring me a piece of the darkest shadow"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann_quests.json
msgid ""
"I am honored to give you this banner.  Wear it with pride, as you more than "
"earned that right."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill a star-crowned hound in my name"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann_quests.json
msgid ""
"Knight, I ask you to kill a star-crowned hound.  This will be a difficult "
"challenge but I trust that you will prevail against this mighty foe.  Kill it"
" and a necklace that will amplify your magical abilities will be yours."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
msgid "I'll do it.  Where's the hound?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill a star-crowned hound in my name"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/boann_quests.json
msgid ""
"It is strong but slow, so disengaging is possible.  It will summon hounds, "
"but they quickly fade away so they aren't that much of an issue compared to "
"it.  Stand away from corners in walls as it can teleport to them.  It has no "
"armor against fire, electricity and blunt weapons but it quickly heal all its"
" wounds so continuous heavy damage is the key to kill it.  If you cannot "
"manage to injure it, do not hesitate to withdraw and try another way to kill "
"it."
msgstr ""

